THIS DIRECTORY IS NOT APACHE-2.0.

Every file in src/backend/internal/ldap is a COMMERCIAL ADD-ON MODULE of
Correlix. It implements the `ldap` entitlement — LDAP / Active Directory
directory authentication — which the owner has placed in the Enterprise tier.

The rest of Correlix is Apache-2.0. Local authentication and OIDC single
sign-on are core, and are unaffected by this notice.

